  "body": "\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"project-media\"><img src=\"../assets/projects/bahrain-water-bubble/exterior.webp?v=2\" alt=\"Outdoor wave-generator concept animating the stepped amphitheatre edge at sunset\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption><span>Open shell on the water</span><span>Wave-generating waterfront experience</span></figcaption></figure>\r\n<section class=\"project-copy\"><h2>CULTURAL IDEA</h2><p>The opened pearl shell becomes a civic-scale landmark with a sheltered performance setting above and an immersive pearl-culture experience below. Terraced seating meets the moving waterfront edge, where water animates the public realm.</p></section>\r\n<div class=\"project-break\"><p class=\"project-kicker\">ARCHITECTURE &amp; PROGRAMME</p><h2>A layered amphitheatre, connected by water.</h2></div>\r\n<figure class=\"project-media\"><img src=\"../assets/projects/bahrain-water-bubble/exploded.webp?v=2\" alt=\"Exploded concept visualization showing the shell canopy, terraced amphitheatre, lower experience spaces and active waterfront edge\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>Layered amphitheatre</span><span>Exploded concept view</span></figcaption></figure>\r\n<section class=\"project-copy\"><h2>SPATIAL STRATEGY</h2><p>A distinctive shell canopy frames the performance space; public seating opens toward the water; lower aquarium and exhibition spaces bring visitors closer to the pearl-diving story; and wave effects animate the steps along the waterfront.</p></section>\r\n<div class=\"project-break\"><p class=\"project-kicker\">VISITOR EXPERIENCE · LIVING HERITAGE</p><h2>The pearl story, brought to life.</h2></div>\r\n<div class=\"project-grid project-grid--gallery\"><figure class=\"project-media\"><img src=\"../assets/projects/bahrain-water-bubble/aquarium.webp?v=2\" alt=\"Concept visualization of visitors viewing live pearl divers in an aquarium\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>Live pearl-diving aquarium</span><span>Heritage interpretation</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"project-media\"><img src=\"../assets/projects/bahrain-water-bubble/water-gallery.webp?v=2\" alt=\"Curving interior water-wall gallery beside a pearl-diving aquarium\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>Water-wall gallery</span><span>Immersive interior</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"project-media\"><img src=\"../assets/projects/bahrain-water-bubble/pearl-archive.webp?v=2\" alt=\"Exhibition concept with pearl displays and archival material\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>Pearl display and archives</span><span>Curated exhibition</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"project-media\"><img src=\"../assets/projects/bahrain-water-bubble/immersive-water-wall.webp?v=2\" alt=\"Visitors experiencing a large illuminated water wall\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption><span>Immersive storytelling</span><span>Water as narrative</span></figcaption></figure></div>\r\n<section class=\"project-copy\"><h2>A CONTINUOUS CULTURAL JOURNEY</h2><p>Live pearl divers create a human-scale encounter. Water walls guide visitors through the interior, while curated pearl displays and archival imagery connect the experience to Bahrain’s maritime memory.</p></section>\r\n<a class=\"project-next\" href=\"paradis-iran.html\"><span>NEXT WATER FEATURE CONCEPT</span><strong>Paradis, Iran →</strong></a>\r\n",
